.TH TRAMPOLINE 1
.SH NAME
trampoline \- relay standard input/output through a network connection
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B trampoline
.I addr
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Trampoline
dials
.I addr
and relays bytes between the resulting connection and its own
standard input and output, so a network service can be driven from
(or piped into) an ordinary command pipeline.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/cmd/trampoline.b
